###Mapping

// The client-portal mapping.
//
// It includes BOTH dependency mappings, which reaches `client_core::Mapping` twice -- once
// through client-reporting and once through fee-billing. The include diamond closes: the
// duplicate resolves to one and nothing is redefined. Neither `client_core::Mapping` nor any
// of the other twelve mappings in the closure is included again here, and none may be.
//
// EXPLICIT SET IDS EVERYWHERE, on both sides. Both dependencies name every one of their sets
// explicitly, so the default ids (`client_reporting_CrpStatement`, `fee_billing_BilInvoice`)
// do not exist to fall back on. Every cross-project association end below therefore names
// [sourceSetId, targetSetId] in full: `statement[cpoDocumentEntry, crpStatement]`. The bare
// `prop: [db]@Join` form resolves only against defaults and fails here with a message naming
// the property rather than the project. The far-side ids -- crpStatement, crpDelivery,
// crpCostsDisclosure, crpDepreciationNotice, bilInvoice, bilDispute -- come from the two
// MANIFESTs and are not derivable from the class names.
//
// This project's own sixteen ids are all cpo-prefixed and all explicit, for the reason a set
// id is prefixed at all: it is a GLOBAL namespace across the compiled graph, and one collision
// fails the whole thing with a message that names the id and not the project. None is marked
// root, so a downstream `extends [...]` must name the id from this project's MANIFEST.
//
// Derived properties are not mapped. The last three sets are rooted on VIEWS, so one instance
// of CpoEntryViewTotal is a document-shaped GROUP and never a reading.
Mapping client_portal::Mapping
(
   include client_reporting::Mapping
   include fee_billing::Mapping

   // ---- identity and access ---------------------------------------------------------------

   client_portal::CpoPortalUser[cpoUser]: Relational
   {
      ~primaryKey
      (
         [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.USER_ID
      )
      ~mainTable [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER
      userId: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.USER_ID,
      loginName: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.LOGIN_NAME,
      displayName: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.DISPLAY_NAME,
      emailAddress: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.EMAIL_ADDRESS,
      userType: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.USER_TYPE,
      status: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.STATUS,
      enrolledOn: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.ENROLLED_ON,
      lastLoginAt: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.LAST_LOGIN_AT,
      lockedOn: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.LOCKED_ON,
      mfaMethod: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.MFA_METHOD,
      preferredLanguage: [client_portal::Store]CPO_USER.PREFERRED_LANGUAGE
   }

